{"sourceUrl":"https://gip.csu.edu.cn/info/1046/8034.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:04.315979+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://gip.csu.edu.cn/info/1046/8034.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><strong><span><span><span><span>为做好</span>2026<span>年我院硕士研究生预推免考核工作，现将有关事项通知如下：</span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、组织机构</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>1.<span>学院研究生招生工作领导小组</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>组</span>  <span>长：</span></span><span><span>李志伟</span></span><span> <span>、</span></span><span><span>邵拥军</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>副组长：</span></span><span><span>冯德山</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>组</span>  <span>员：各系招生工作负责人</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>2.<span>学院研究生招生思想政治表现考核小组 </span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>组</span>  <span>长：</span></span><span><span>邵拥军</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>副组长：</span></span><span><span>刘浩</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>组</span>  <span>员：各系党支部书记、面试专家</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、考核对象</span> </span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>由学院招生工作</span></span><span><span>领导小</span></span><span><span>组从已经通过</span><span>“</span><span>中南大学推免生服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>（</span></span><a href=\"https://yjszsgl.csu.edu.cn/zsgl2026/tmsgl/default.aspx）网上报名（报名截止日期：9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>https://yjszsgl.csu.edu.cn/zsgl2026/tmsgl/default.aspx<span>）网上报名（</span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>报名截止日期：</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></strong></span></a><strong><span><span>月</span><span>1</span></span></strong><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>的</span></span><span><span>申请人员中进行选拔。</span></span><span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span>3</span><span><span>日，学生可通过报名网站点击</span><span>“申请状态查询”，如状态为“申请信息院系审核合格”即为取得考核资格。可参加现场考核；如显示“待审核”，则是审核不合格，学院不再另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>申请人必须保证提交的申请信息及全部申请材料的真实性和准确性。凡弄虚作假者，一经查实，资格无效</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、工作原则</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span></span><span>.<span>坚持</span><span>“</span><span>按需招生、德智体全面衡量、择优录取、宁缺毋滥</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span>.<span>坚持公平、公正、公开的原则。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、考核工作安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>1.<span>资格审查</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>获得考核资格的学生在考核时需提交以下资格审查材料：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）身份证</span></span><span><span>、学生证</span></span><span><span>扫描件</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）本科</span></span><span><span>阶段</span></span><span><span>学习成绩单</span></span><span><span>一份，并由所在学校或院系的教务部门加盖公章扫描件；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>3<span>）最高等级的英语水平测试证书</span></span><span><span>扫描</span></span><span><span>件</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>4<span>）各项能证明自己学业水平的论文和获奖情况等</span></span><span><span>扫描件</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>2.<span>考核方式、时间、地点 </span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>考核方式：线下面试</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>考核时间地点：</span></span><strong><span>2025<span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>7</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span>-1</span></strong><strong><span><span>8</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><span><span>，具体考核时间和地点另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>3.<span>考核内容</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span>1<span>）思想政治表现考核</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>思想政治表现考核等级为</span><span>“</span><span>合格</span><span>”</span><span>和</span><span>“</span><span>不合格</span><span>”</span><span>，不合格不予预录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span>2<span>）专业基础测试</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>专业基础测试采取抽题问答或随机问答方式，</span><span>满分为</span>100<span>分。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span>3<span>）综合素质及能力测试</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>综合素质及能力测试采取随机问答方式，满分为</span>100<span>分。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>4</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）外语能力测试</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>外语能力测试采取听说交流方式，满分为</span>100<span>分。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>4.<span>总成绩计算</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>总成绩</span>=<span>专业基础测试</span><span>+</span><span>综合素质及能力测试</span><span>+</span><span>外语能力测试。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>5.<span>拟录取说明</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>申请人取得正式推免资格后在教育部规定时间内登录教育部全国推免服务系统进行报名，并完成填报志愿，我院将根据</span></span><span><span>报名情况择优</span></span><span><span>发送复试通知，学生接受复试确认、接受待录取确认后，方可正式完成推免录取。推免服务系统开放时间请关注中国研究生招生信息网相关公告。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>联系方式</span></span></strong><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：</span></span><span><span>葛老师</span></span><span><span>；电话：</span>0731-88879331<span>；邮箱：</span><span>727710934@qq.com</span><span>；地址：中南大学</span></span><span><span>潇湘校区地球科学楼</span><span>1</span></span><span>05<span>。</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"166d312ccdfcce3fa87a745e9c21162a05a7f2593b5c33ac82817e7b7b266bd4","textLength":1016,"sourceSha256":"2b2746e8c975fa25b579bd3f34134fd9968cbcea03bdd8c30894d07a82798e42","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ce7dd1ea82324f340843","title":"2025年中南大学地球科学与信息物理学院2026年硕士研究生预推免考核工作通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:04.315979+00:00"}
